 INSERT INTO test_diary VALUES(8,'BOB-137','2026-08-20T16:01:43Z','AI-agent','PASS','ROOT CAUSE ESTABLISHED via self-dumped stacks: Deduplicator.merge_results() runs O(N^2) regex work synchronously on the asyncio event loop (search.py:914, plain sync call)','16 dumps across 3 episodes. Loop thread sustained d_utime 81-98 ticks/sec while every other thread showed 0. Outer frames identical (merge_results -> _check_match), inner frame moves between dumps = executing, not blocked. Repro 22/26 probes found 7187 dead, 0/26 found 7186 dead, same socket fingerprint as the original report; precondition OBSERVED not constructed. REFUTES two of my own Rev-2 readings: ''thread in state R wchan=0'' is the OBSERVER itself (re-verified independently), and ps %CPU is a lifetime average not an instantaneous rate. SIGTERM-needs-SIGKILL decoupled: reproduces on a healthy container, caused by main()''s two 5s joins vs podman''s 10s grace. No fix applied per the Iron Law.','status unchanged',0,NULL,NULL,'docs/qa/BOB-137/forensics.md','boot_service','2026-08-20 16:01:43');
